about his fiancée.

5
00:00:14,672 --> 00:00:16,632
(Howard:)I'm sorry, what?

6
00:00:17,717 --> 00:00:19,757
(Raj:)Rubbish. He's talking rubbish.

7
00:00:19,927 --> 00:00:22,717
(Leonard:)Oh, Bernadette, please play my clarinet

8
00:00:24,265 --> 00:00:27,475
(Raj:)That could have been about anyone.

9
00:00:28,686 --> 00:00:32,106
(Raj:)You have nothing to worry about,
because now I'm the dusky haIf...

10
00:00:32,273 --> 00:00:33,563
(Raj:)...of Koothrapenny.

11
00:00:34,734 --> 00:00:36,694
(Sheldon:)For the record, I do have genitals.

12
